rmance-based services from us. Any decline in our user renewals or upgrades or performance-based services could harm our future operating results.","section":"•the effects of seasonal trends on our results of operations;","block":72,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001617553-26-000046","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001617553","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1617553/000161755326000046/zip-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4ae027e9c9f368bdde5767651d93f3730c264ec4cbdf21f964f6148101a5db89.bin","sha256":"4ae027e9c9f368bdde5767651d93f3730c264ec4cbdf21f964f6148101a5db89"}},{"id":"f8fb4f84fae4392a7b31c8dd866aef71cf159d9cce34830729e53a993dc4bf9d","quote":"•Our business depends largely on our ability to attract and retain talented employees, including senior management and key personnel. In particular, if we lose the services of Ian Siegel, our Chief Executive Officer, or other members of our senior management team, we may not be able to execute on our business strategy.","context":"•Significant segments of the market for job advertisement services may have hiring needs and service preferences that are subject to greater volatility than the overall economy.","section":"•the effects of seasonal trends on our results of operations;","block":73,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001617553-26-000046","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001617553","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1617553/000161755326000046/zip-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4ae027e9c9f368bdde5767651d93f3730c264ec4cbdf21f964f6148101a5db89.bin","sha256":"4ae027e9c9f368bdde5767651d93f3730c264ec4cbdf21f964f6148101a5db89"}},{"id":"4c5505dcc865946d31277e09ac70b3c0e9487bcdd14893d4450797abdd9f935d","quote":"•If internet search engines’ methodologies or other channels that we use to direct traffic to our website are modified to our disadvantage, or our search result page rankings decline for other reasons, our user growth could decline.","context":"•Our business depends largely on our ability to attract and retain talented employees, including senior management and key personnel. In particular, if we lose the services of Ian Siegel, our Chief Executive Officer, or other members of our senior management team, we may not be able to execute on our business strategy.","section":"•the effects of seasonal trends on our results of operations;","block":74,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001617553-26-000046","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001617553","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1617553/000161755326000046/zip-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4ae027e9c9f368bdde5767651d93f3730c264ec4cbdf21f964f6148101a5db89.bin","sha256":"4ae027e9c9f368bdde5767651d93f3730c264ec4cbdf21f964f6148101a5db89"}},{"id":"ee36be67e85faae4ada9802cb2b8d692484616a136648263f8625468ae8a6bb2","quote":"•Our quarterly results may fluctuate significantly and may not fully reflect the underlying performance of our business, which makes our future results difficult to predict.","context":"•If internet search engines’ methodologies or other channels that we use to direct traffic to our website are modified to our disadvantage, or our search result page rankings decline for other reasons, our user growth could decline.","section":"•the effects of seasonal trends on our results of operations;","block":75,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001617553-26-000046","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-05","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001617553","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1617553/000161755326000046/zip-